Interesting comparison.  I was thinking along those lines--an estimate of herd size and herd-level detection events, but then realized the herd membership likely changes through time and it would be difficult to put an identity to each herd, a point you also recognize.  There might be some mega model with herd dynamics here.  GPS data would help greatly in estimating the spatial dynamics.

